<title>USA: Hercules names Vincent Corbo Pres/COO.</title>
<headline>Hercules names Vincent Corbo Pres/COO.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hercules Inc said Friday that Vincent Corbo was elected to the new position of president and chief operating officer and a member of the board, effective February 24.</p>
<p>He will report to R. Keith Elliott, who continues as chairman and chief executive officer, though he stepped down as president.</p>
<p>Corbo's most recent position with the company was executive vice president in charge of technology and two divisions.</p>
</text>
